<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.62 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.62 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.62 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Feb 13		     12,700</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Feb		6,346</p>
<p> Average reserves to Feb 10			   5,860</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,617</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
